{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ちゃんモデルおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんにあった瞬間一番に伝えた～嬉しすぎて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前仕事でタクシー乗ってて\nろってぃーとまあやで歌ってたら\n運転手さんもノッてきてくれる方で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢僕ね～趣味で作詞作曲してんだよ！\nちょっと聞いてくれる？｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言って本気で歌ってくれて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の歌を届けたい！聞いてくれ！って感じだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの位作詞作曲に時間かかるんですか～？とか沢山お話して楽しい時間だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもまあやとろってぃーはタクシーのったら変な話しかしてないよね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｒの法則も見てくれたってコメントに沢山あって嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｒの公式LINEもまあやの写真送られてきたよ～っとか書いてあって見てくれたんだっ♡って思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48のめぐちゃんと服が似てて\nみんなに合わせたの？って聞かれたけどたまたまなの～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄いよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人で生放送前にご飯食べたんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと同じＮＨＫのケータイ大喜利の公開収録にも参加させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"司会の今田耕司さん\n審査委員長の板尾創路さん\n投稿紹介の千原ジュニアさん\nゲストの\n阿藤快さん、蛭子能収さん、さだまさしさん、山下真司さん山村紅葉さん和田アキ子さん高山善廣さん\nそしてめっちゃ可愛くて癒されたななみちゃんなど素敵な方と楽しく番組出来ました！\nぜひお見逃しなく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◌⑅⃝●♡⋆♡⃝ ˻˳˯ₑ♡⃝⋆●♡⑅⃝◌ᙚᵐⁱᒻᵉ¨̮♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎえいごも見たよーって言うのもたくさんあった～みんな面白かったっていってくれたからなんか良かったかな？って思ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東進ハイスクールの安河内先生も面白くて教えるの上手ですぐ入ってきた～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドランクドラゴンさんもすっごい面白かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レギュラー番組これからもがんばってまいるぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島ホームテレビの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鯉のはなシアター"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にまた出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはなんと出演最多数らしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか嬉しいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして舞台｢じょしらく｣観に行きたかったよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストや仕事と重なって観れなかった...\nみんなお疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中や楽屋で必死に台本とか読んでる姿かっこよかった！だからまあやも勉強とかがんばろっ！！！って思えたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてれなち...もう最近全然あえなくて寂しいけど学業に専念頑張ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決断するのもいろいろ悩んだと思うけどみんなれなちの味方だからあまり考え過ぎずに頑張って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして鳥居坂４６オーディション始まったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それについてコメントが欲しいと沢山あったので..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと今のわたし達にとっていい刺激にもなると思います！\nそして大切な仲間も増える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもかといって全く不安にならないかと言われると不安です。( ๑⃙⃘⌤๑⃙⃘ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも入ってくることで刺激にもなるし勉強にもなると思う。\n乃木坂もどんどん進化していかなくてはならないと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて書いていいかわかんないけど\nみんな仲間であって良きライバル！\nお互いを尊敬しあっていて\nファンの方と一緒に坂の上の目標に向かって頑張ってるから\nファンの方に教わることも沢山あるし\nメンバースタッフファンの方の一体感は\n｢乃木坂だなぁ｣\nって感じることがよくある！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文章ではなんて伝えていいかわかんないしぐちゃぐちゃになっちゃった...\nでもこれまた面白い名前だよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0033.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このちょっぴり写ってる青い服\n琴子なんだけど、長袖の羽織りもの着てて...このまあやとのthe✩summerっていう感じと真逆でびっくりした～(⑅ ॣ•͈૦•͈ ॣ)꒳ᵒ꒳ᵎᵎᵎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もテスト期間なので頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では洗濯物してきます～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/05/7038195/0037.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}